## 1. Rules for this port

- Clean room: spec sessions study the game and write only specs/__ID__/;
  implementation sessions read only the specs and our code
  (docs/CONTRIBUTING-GAMES.md). No leaked, decompiled or SDK code.
- No game files, extracted files or keys in the repository: the game's
  files are read at run time from the player's own install or the
  owner's asset service.

